  "description": {
   "text": "Conjure Air Elemental\n(Conjuration/Summoning)\n\nLevel: 6\nRange: 35 ft.\nDuration: 1 turn/level\nCasting Time: 9\nArea of Effect: Special\nSaving Throw: None\n\nSummons an air elemental for 1 turn per caster level, to a maximum of 20 turns. The chance of summoning a 12-, 16-, or 24-Hit-Dice elemental is 64% / 35% / 1% at 11th level, 61% / 37% / 2% at 12th, 52% / 42% / 6% at 15th, and 37% / 51% / 12% at 20th level; it scales evenly between those levels. The elemental obeys the caster without a control contest."
